                  "name": "create_file",
                  "arguments": "{\"content\":\"# Copilot Instructions for ADK-Java\\n\\n## Project Overview\\n- **ADK-Java** is a modular toolkit for building, evaluating, and deploying AI agents in Java, with deep integration for Google Cloud and flexible orchestration.\\n- Major components:\\n  - `core/`: Core ADK library and agent abstractions\\n  - `contrib/`: Community-contributed agents/tools (no API stability guarantees)\\n  - `dev/`: Development utilities (e.g., Spring REST server)\\n  - `maven_plugin/`: Maven plugin for launching the ADK web server and managing agents\\n\\n## Key Workflows\\n- **Build:**\\n  - Use Maven: `mvn compile` (from project root or submodule)\\n- **Run Agents (Web UI):**\\n  - Start server: `mvn google-adk:web -Dagents=com.example.AgentLoader.INSTANCE`\\n  - Access UI: [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000)\\n  - Customize port/host: `-Dport=9090 -Dhost=0.0.0.0`\\n- **AgentLoader Pattern:**\\n  - Implement `com.google.adk.maven.AgentLoader` to register agents\\n  - Use static `INSTANCE` or default constructor for loader\\n  - Example: see `maven_plugin/examples/simple-agent/SimpleAgentLoader.java`\\n\\n## Patterns & Conventions\\n- **Agents:**\\n  - Extend `BaseAgent` or use `LlmAgent.builder()` for agent creation\\n  - Register agents by name in `listAgents()` and `loadAgent(String name)`\\n  - Use descriptive `instruction` and `model` fields\\n- **Tools:**\\n  - Integrate tools via agent builder (e.g., `GoogleSearchTool`)\\n- **Testing:**\\n  - Unit/integration tests in `src/test/java/`\\n- **Contrib:**\\n  - No API stability; rapid iteration encouraged\\n\\n## Integration Points\\n- **Maven Plugin:**\\n  - Add plugin to `pom.xml` for short commands\\n  - Use direct coordinates for plugin-less runs\\n- **External Protocols:**\\n  - A2A protocol supported for agent-to-agent communication\\n\\n## Examples\\n- See `maven_plugin/examples/simple-agent/README.md` for agent loader and customization\\n- See `dev/README.md` for development server utilities\\n\\n## Tips for AI Agents\\n- Prefer code-first agent definitions for flexibility\\n- Use hot reloading (`-DhotReloading=true`) for rapid development\\n- Reference ADK documentation: https://google.github.io/adk-docs\\n\\n---\\nFor unclear or missing conventions, ask maintainers or check referenced READMEs for up-to-date patterns.\\n\",\"filePath\":\"/workspaces/adk-java/.github/copilot-instructions.md\"}",
                  "id": "call_48yYIixrvZlzYKZq8jHU2VbJ__vscode-1755034504364"
